Installation & Setup 🛠️
Clone or navigate to the project directory:

Bash
cd /root/openaiproject
Create and activate a Python virtual environment:

Bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
Install dependencies:

Bash
pip install openai
Configure your environment variables:
Ensure your credentials are available in your shell session (typically loaded from ~/.bash_profile):

Bash
source ~/.bash_profile
Usage 🚀
To run the generator script and output a commit message based on your code changes, execute:

Bash
python3 commit_generator.py
Preview & Output 📊
Input Change Summary
